The Baggywrinkle is wallet originally designed by Deyan ([@dsleathergoods](https://instagram.com/dsleathergoods) on Instagram). Deyan sells [his patterns](https://www.etsy.com/listing/1355061032/leather-wallet-pdf-pattern-wallet?utm_source=lord.crofte.fr) worldwide and if you are a crafter, make sure to check out his [Etsy Shop](https://www.etsy.com/shop/DSLeatherGoods?utm_source=lord.crofte.fr).

This minimalist wallet as 2 main slots where you can put around 8 to 10 cards each. If you prefer storing cash and coins, you can also use one of these pockets to do so.

Between the main pockets, you’ll find a flap pocket where you can safely store ticket, bills or cash.

## Customization

Colors are always the ones I or my clients chose, so don’t hesitate to ask for customization. I’ll tell you what color I have available in terms of leather, thread and snap button. Don’t be shy 🙂

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

